# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Reference data — researchers' data must never be committed (FOUNDATIONS §6).
# Ignore ALL of data/ (not just *.mat): CSV/JSON derived from recordings are
# raw-adjacent and must not leak either. Only a README may be tracked, so the
# directory's purpose is documented without shipping any data.
# Promote a file to a golden test asset deliberately, never by accident.
data/*
!data/README.md

# darkroom/ — local-only figures developed from reference data (never committed).
darkroom/

# exports/ — CSV produced by scripts/mat2csv.py from reference .mat data.
# Researchers' data must never be committed (FOUNDATIONS §6); the converter is
# tracked, its output is not.
exports/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
